# Windsurf Cascade Rules for DopaBrain

> **Primary Source of Truth:** `CLAUDE.md`
> All operational invariants, coding standards, and repository boundaries are defined in `CLAUDE.md`.

## Core Invariants
- **Operational URL:** `https://dopabrain.com/`
- **Core Routes:** Stress Check, HSP Test, 2048 Coach (Secondary: Brain Type, IQ Test, Future Self, K-pop Role Roster).
- **12 Supported Locales:** `ko en zh hi ru ja es pt id tr de fr` (via `data-i18n` and JSON locales).
- **Mobile First:** Touch target >= 44px, 0 horizontal overflow.
- **Git Submodules:** `projects/*` may be independent Git repositories. Commit/push submodules first, then root pointer.
- **Documentation:** Never accumulate session transcripts in Markdown. Keep `PROGRESS.md` current and commit history in Git.

